# AEGIS test-layer static analysis (AEGIS-227, AEGIS-233).
#
# Inherits the root configuration and relaxes two checks that measure the
# GoogleTest macros rather than the test:
#
#   readability-function-cognitive-complexity — every TEST() body expands into
#     branches from EXPECT_*; the reported complexity is the macro's, not the
#     test's, and chasing it would push assertions out of the test that needs them.
#   misc-use-anonymous-namespace — TEST() already gives each body internal linkage.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -misc-use-anonymous-namespace
